</strong> Fallen disciples still help by collecting crystals</p>[/]<br></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Scalable for large groups:</strong> Supports 5 to 100 players per match</p>[/]</li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Who do you trust? Who deceives you? And who brings the Armageddon?</strong></p>",
